title: A computer never set up that signs in takes the settings kept on GitHub (status bar hidden there)
folders: rust-small
github: settings-hide-status.json
expect-file: ../data/prefs.json :: "status": false
expect-log: script: Account\("menu"\)
forbid-log: Could not

wait 2500
account signin
wait 800
mark a-code
wait 4500
mark b-signed-in
wait 400
account menu
wait 2500
mark c-menu
wait 400
quit
